The program can be run using make. 

make build

This loads and preprocesses the data, calculates WHO z-scores, creates longitudinal growth features, performs GMM, and reports on it.

make eda

This generates plots examining height and weight by age and sex, as well as 50 randomly selected individual growth trajectories.

make diagnostics

This reports missing values, extreme z-scores, measurement counts, follow-up duration, and other data-quality information.

make logistics

This does the logistic regression and reports the data. 

make clean

This removes the virtual enviorment.